/T (\376\377\000p\0001\0001\000L\000i\000n\000e\0002\000H\000e\000a\000l\000t\000h\000\133\0000\000\135)
/TU (Part 11\056 Statement for Applicants With a Class A\056 Tuberculosis Condition \050As Defined By H H S Regulations\051\056 Statement by Local \050City or County\051 Health Department\056 NOTE\072  The physician at the local health department in the area where the alien plans to reside should complete this statement\056 I agree to supply any treatment or observation necessary for the proper management and continued care of the alien\047s tuberculosis condition\056 Within 30 days of the alien reporting for care\054 I agree to submit a summary of my initial evaluation of the alien\047s condition\054 indicate presumptive diagnosis\054 and provide test results and plans for future care of the alien to the State Health Department Official named in the Endorsement of State Health Department Official section and to the Division of Global Migration and Quarantine \050E 0 3\051\054 Centers for Disease Control and Prevention \050C D C\051\054 Atlanta\054 Georgia 30333\056 I also agree to report the alien if the alien has not reported within 30 days after receiving notice from the Division of Global Migration and Quarantine\054 C D C\056 Satisfactory financial arrangements have been made\056  \050This statement does not relieve the alien from submitting evidence\054 as required by a U\056S\056 Consulate\054 to establish that the alien is not likely to become a public charge\056\051 I represent \050select the appropriate box and give the complete name\054 address\054 certification\054 and contact information of the health department\051\056 2\056 A\056 Select City Health Department\056)
/Type /Annot
>>
endobj
